<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>Notwithstanding Section 17534, a violation of this article shall not be a crime. However, all available civil remedies that apply to a violation of this article may be employed.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>If a business complies with the provisions of this article in good faith, it shall not be subject to civil
				  remedies.</p></caml:Content>